Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,The Deadlock
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, as the countdown to the bomb crisis facing the goats and Wolffy began,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor stepped in to save them but was captured by Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera dispatched robots to hunt down the goats and Wolffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,while she leisurely headed to the finals, which was about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The two elders decided to sacrifice themselves so the goats and Wolffy could make it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.68,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you should rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:00:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to practice a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother is working so hard…and talented, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.52,0:01:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll definitely uphold our family’s honor in this Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vera, here—this wristband is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One for you, and one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll wear our wristband and win the Basketball Game championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.52,0:01:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky Hawk scores!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The final champions are—Team Gliders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:01:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way…we actually lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn’t win by just one basket…Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic…absolutely pathetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn’t even stop Sky Hawk…He couldn’t even stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost all because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks so incredibly weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go; it’s a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not watching anything he’s in anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, I’m done watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying that? Didn’t you guys support my brother before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost. Stop embarrassing yourselves out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop embarrassing yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go; it’s absolutely infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop embarrassing yourself. What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to see you…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing right by your fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re letting your fans down. Stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re terrible. Despite all your talk of talent, you still lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I could play better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lex falters; Team Wolves suffers a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves suffers a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all his fault. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn’t deserve to be captain! He doesn’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Replace the captain! Get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the use of second place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.96,0:03:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wolf Clan has completely lost face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we’ve lost it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, come out and have something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven’t eaten for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will win back the honor we lost all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Report: we only caught two old goats; the others escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes no difference if they show up; the championship is still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:04:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we arrive at the final match of the Grassland Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now walking out is…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We just received the latest roster, and Victor is actually missing from the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking his place is the manager, Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves truly live up to their reputation as the best of the best—even their manager plays basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking toward us on the other side is…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How come Weslie and the others still haven’t arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The finals are starting in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And Auntie Goat, too—she usually arrives even earlier than the referees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.64,0:05:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Their coaching staff hasn’t shown up either…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren’t they here yet? Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, hurry up and answer the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn’t Team Goats arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that they’re too scared to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Team Defenders is going to miss this grand final.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby announce…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Since
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the competing team failed to arrive on time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.60,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the winner of this match is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wol—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we’re late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders has actually walked into the arena at the very last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn’t Daddy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that you’d choose to compete after all, ignoring even your coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you any different from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}are{\i0} different from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely bring Slowy and Coach back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, don’t you dare lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ll be fine—just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We are live at the grand finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Both teams are ready to go; who will ultimately take home the championship?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What right does this Vera have to step in for Victor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at her, you can tell she lacks ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She jumped so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s so high…really high.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she actually has some skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is—Weslie’s Lightning Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie has already dribbled past the halfway line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so—this girl just doesn’t cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Such intense pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves scores again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The four players from Team Wolves are displaying incredible skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves has widened the gap to 18 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How have they changed so drastically overnight…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders is being completely suppressed by Team Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four must have been controlled by Vera using that device, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An 18-point lead already? It looks like the little goats are done for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I have to take them out to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up; you can’t beat the upgraded Team Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m looking forward to facing you on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely won’t lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders is finally launching a counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If they can break through Vera now, Team Defenders might just turn the tide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.52,0:09:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Such immense power…I can’t hold it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That just now…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Faced with such overwhelming power, you are destined to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that cool pose just now, the scattering feathers…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s exactly like my signature move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She…she’s been using our signature moves the whole time, hasn’t she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.32,0:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me she knows my signature move too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected Vera to be hiding her true strength all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She can actually use the signature moves of the four top captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn’t that make her the strongest player on the court?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s been an accident on the field; it looks like Weslie took a pretty hard hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Blazey…Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowy, Coach,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,hang in there, I’m coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there still so many robots?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
